# ===== HISTOIRE 17 — TRANCE / GOA (Allemagne-Goa, ~1994) =====
# Un 303 qui roule sans fin, une supersaw euphorique, une montée hypnotique.
# Le filtre qui s'ouvre (lp 600..2200) = toute la tension du genre.
title:  Trance
bpm:    144
key:    a minor
duck:   45
scene:  kaleido
song:   intro*4 main*16 out*4
kick:  x . . . x . . . x . . . x . . . | sample bd | gain 0.5 | in main out
oh:    . . x . . . x . . . x . . . x . | sample oh | gain 0.1 | in main
roll:  1 1 1' 1 5 1 1' 1 4 1 1' 1 5 1 6 1 | saw | oct 2 | slide | lp 600..2200 | over 8 | q 8 | drive 0.3 | gate 0.4 | gain 0.12 | in main out
saw:   Am . . . F . . . C . . . E . . . | saw | supersaw | lp 1600 | env 0.01 0.2 0.7 0.4 | reverb 0.5 | gain 0.09 | in main
pad@out: Am9 . . . | saw | unison 5 | lp 900 | env 1.5 0.8 0.7 3 | reverb 0.8 | gain 0.08
